      "value": "@{5a75754b71048b2a29100660|full_name}: Loop time is an option set on the animation clip itself. There is no reason why the animation component shouldn't be able to have 2 animation clips (One looping, say for eyeblinking if you decide to not use the simulated eyetracking way. One playing once, for spawn in effect) playing at the same time.\nJust because one is playing, doesn't mean it can't mix with another.",
