      "value": "@{58c6b8f8227a56787575ebc0|full_name}: If you use a generic rig, maybe, or only toggle editor settings in the animation. The game takes control of the humanoid avatar from the start, so any bone animation outside the VRChat animation controller will be ignored.\n\nYou could use a duplicate, but that's exactly the sort of janky workaround that justifies a feature request.",
      "viewerReactions": null
